      "writtenOn": "2024-02-01T16:17:13Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Are there any scenarios where the `irq-gpios` entry could be different per device tree node? Would it be better to refactor the device tree binding to help illustrate the PDC ports are tied to the same `irq-gpios`?",
      "revId": "c3c165433da98230e4947f925a994156c003579b",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "58a01cd8_0e155902",
        "filename": "zephyr/drivers/usbc/pdc_rts54xx.c",
        "patchSetId": 2
      },
      "lineNbr": 1720,
